stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Initiated : Resident submits report

    Initiated --> Cancelled : Resident cancels ticket
    Initiated --> Open : AI reviewed [needs manual review = false]
    Initiated --> Pending_Review : AI reviewed [needs manual review = true]

    Pending_Review --> Open : Manual approved
    Pending_Review --> Rejected : Manual rejected
    Open --> Rejected : Authority rejected

    Open --> Assigned : Route & Assigned
    Assigned --> Assigned : Reassigned
    Assigned --> In_Progress : Work started
    In_Progress --> Open : Rerouted
    Open --> Cancelled : Resident cancels ticket

    In_Progress --> Resolved : Evidence submitted
    Resolved --> In_Progress : Evidence rejected
    Resolved --> Completed : Closed

    Completed --> [*] : Archive ticket
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]